    <crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>a kind of fine linen, resembling cambric (the usual measure of which is papir) (OED s.v. lawn sb.1 1) | a kind of fine linen, resembling cambric (OED s.v. lawn, n.1) | a kind of fine linen, resembling cambric (the usual measure of which is papir) (OED s.v. lawn sb.1 1), here narrow | a kind of fine linen, resembling cambric (OED s.v. lawn sb.1 1) | 23, | a kind of fine linen, resembling cambric (the usual measure of which is papir) (OED s.v. lawn sb.1 1), here of low quality</crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>
